3D props: Poly Haven (CC0): desk lamp "Desk Lamp Arm 01", "Tea Set 01", texture "American Walnut Veneer". The room light is a synthetic HDRI made in this repo.
Fonts: Fredoka and Lilita One, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL.txt).
Music and sound: synthesised in mix.py. No samples.
